fullDescription.text:
Reports public properties of an object with specified types. Suggests specifying the shape of the returned object via the '#[ObjectShape]' attribute or an object shape in the PHPDoc comment. Example: '$a = new stdClass();
  $a->name = "name";
  $a->age = 2;' After the quick-fix is applied: '/** @var $a object{name: string, age: int} */
  $a = new stdClass();
  $a->name = "name";
  $a->age = 2;'

fullDescription.markdown:
Reports public properties of an object with specified types. Suggests specifying the shape of the returned object via the `#[ObjectShape]` attribute or an object shape in the PHPDoc comment.

